			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Update Documentation/Rust submodule to purge stale rustdoc artifacts\n\nThe Documentation/Rust submodule has been updated to remove accumulated rustdoc-generated HTML pages, search index shards, static fonts, and trait implementation JS files that no longer reflect the current Grove extension host API surface.\n\nThis resets the documentation tree so subsequent rustdoc regeneration produces accurate, up-to-date cross-references and signature documentation from the current source.",
			"SHA": "b60c2d371a826508df5a73e543312f987616b44e"
