				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Align integration point formatting in DeepDive documentation\n\nSynchronized the markdown table formatting in the Integration Points section of DeepDive.md to maintain consistent column alignment. Adjusted spacing in the Mechanism column to match the visual style of other tables in the Documentation/GitHub folder.\n\nThis ensures the documentation renders properly on GitHub and maintains visual consistency with the surrounding architecture documentation.",
			"SHA": "b82f20189e49382079fea9a69e94fbfa65fd5a7c"
		},
